            "reviewBody": "I diced onion &amp; mushrooms &amp; cooked down in some butter. I then proceeded to follow the recipe, except I used Worcestershire instead of soy. Kids love it!!",
            "datePublished": "2023-05-16T23:08:53.583Z"
