            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Frank Ebell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yes, I did make changes. I added 1 tablespoon of butter, used 1 tablespoon Worcestershire sauce instead of Soy sauce, and added 2 tablespoons of chopped fresh parsley. However, when I made it as written, it was still very good! Thanks for the recipe, it's a keeper! Also, mix flour in jar with 1/2 of the beef broth and shake vigorously until well blended and pour into remaining broth.",
            "datePublished": "2025-01-06T22:10:43.610Z"
          },
