            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made about a pound and a half of meatballs to go with it and used a whole bag of wide egg noodles, I would definitely double to recipe. Also, added sautéed onions, garlic and mushrooms. Definitely was generous with the soy sauce and my tip is make sure you keep stirring. Family loved it !",
            "datePublished": "2023-09-17T22:43:18.320Z"
